    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get the pros and cons, but looking at the long-term brand health, doesn't 'neutrality' just look like cowardice in today's market? Like, if we don't pick a side, aren't we basically just waiting for our brand to become irrelevant to the next generation of buyers?",
